{"articleNo":"148127","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=148127&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] [생협]2016년 1학기 책벼룩시장 접수목록 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.03.09","hit":"10742","attachments":[{"name":"책벼룩시장목록.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=148127&attachNo=22899"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">금오공대 학생들의 건전한 소비문화를 확산하기 위해서 2016년도 1학기 책벼룩시장을 실시하여 740여권의 도서를 접수 마감하였습니다.</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2016년 3월 10일 ~ 11일까지 2일 동안 서적을 판매하오니 많은 참여 부탁드립니다.</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\" color=\"#000000\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">1. 행사주관 : 생활협동조합, 학생복지위원회</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\" color=\"#000000\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2. 판매기간 : 2016 .3. 10(목) ~ 11(금)</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\" color=\"#000000\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">3. 판매장소 :&nbsp;학생회관 1층</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">4. 판매시간 : </font><font color=\"#0055ff\"><strong>12:00 ~ 18:00</strong></font></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">5. 판매서적 : </font><font color=\"#0055ff\"><strong>도서목록 파일첨부</strong></font></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\" color=\"#000000\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">6. 판매대금관리 : 행사종료 후 일괄지급</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\">2016. 03. 09.</span></span></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 36pt\">금오공대생활협동조합이사장</span></span></font></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
